<title>FINLAND: INCAP SURGES, LIVELY AFTER Q1 REPORT.</title>
<headline>INCAP SURGES, LIVELY AFTER Q1 REPORT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in Finnish electronics and furniture subcontractor Incap Oy surged on Friday in an early flurry of OTC action fuelled mainly by domestic demand after it reported a sharp upturn in Q1 results.</p>
<p>At 1140/0840 GMT, Incap was up 6.50 markka or 13 percent at 55.50 markka in very active trade at around 19 million markka.</p>
<p>&quot;I believe it will stay at 55-56 markka levels,&quot; said one broker.</p>
<p>-- Helsinki newsroom +3589 6805 0247, e-mail news@reuters.fi</p>
